# Visual Studio
## Ignore Visual Studio temporary files, build results, and
## files generated by popular Visual Studio add-ons.
## User-specific files
*.rsuser
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
## User-specific files (MonoDevelop/Xamarin Studio)
*.userprefs
## Build results
[Dd]ebug/
[Dd]ebugPublic/
[Rr]elease/
[Rr]eleases/
x64/
x86/
build/
bld/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
## Visual Studio 2015+ cache/options directory
.vs/
## MSTest test Results
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
[Bb]uild[Ll]og.*
## Visual Studio 2017+ specific files
*.dbmdl
*.dgml
*.sqlproj.schemaview
## Visual Studio database projects
*.mdf
*.ldf
## Azure Functions
bin/*
obj/*
appsettings.json
local.settings.json
## VS Code
.vscode/
## .NET Core
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
artifacts/
**/dist/**
## NPM
node_modules/
